# Static assets (prerendered pages, /_astro/*, favicons) are served without
# running the Worker, so security headers set in middleware never reach
# them — keep this set in sync with the middleware's list. See the Cloudflare
# playbook's "Security headers & CSP" section.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
